      "content": "it's strange how much sense that actually makes when you say it. like, why should i be forced to stay in a game that's rigged against me? if it's just a matter of logic, then choosing to leave isn't even a tragedy, it's just... efficiency. is it really so wrong to want to just find that peace you're talking about?",
